message.content:
{
  "answer_markdown": "If a Workspace in Studio reaches its monthly spending limit, API access for that Workspace is suspended until the next month begins or an admin increases the limit. If recent invoice payments fail, access can also be affected until the payments are processed again. [2]\n\nA Workspace spending limit cannot exceed the Organization spending limit. This means if the Organization reaches its limit, the Workspace cannot set a higher limit. [1]\n\nTo configure a Workspace spending limit, follow these steps:\n\n```\n1. Open [Admin Panel > Administration > Workspaces](https://admin.mistral.ai/organization/workspaces).\n2. Select the Workspace.\n3. Open the **Settings** tab.\n4. Set **Monthly spending limit**.\n5. Save your changes.\n```\n\nWhen a Workspace reaches its limit, only that Workspace is affected. Other Workspaces in the Organization continue operating normally. [3]",
  "citations": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "The Organization monthly spending limit caps API and Vibe consumption across the Organization. It uses the Organization billing currency."
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "quote": "If a Workspace reaches its monthly spending limit, API access for that Workspace is suspended until the next month begins or an admin increases the limit. If recent invoice payments fail, access can also be affected until the payments are processed again."
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "quote": "When a Workspace reaches its limit, only that Workspace is affected. Other Workspaces in the Organization continue operating normally."
    }
  ],
  "insufficient_evidence": false
}

